# Anti-leak (VoltPulse)

**Manager must see VoltPulse — not a renamed clone.**

## OK

- Same *conceptual* open stack (Kafka, Flink, Nest, DeepStream, MediaMTX-class)
- Patterns: ingest → perception → bus → rules → API → UI
- Fresh code + VoltPulse contracts

## Forbidden

- Internal product names (Trinetra / T-Netra / etc.) in README, UI, PPT, submission, code comments meant for public
- Copy proprietary source, contracts, topic catalogs, UI chrome, diagram boxes
- Secrets, internal endpoints, customer corridors, internal weight filenames
- “Copy folder then rename”

## Must differ

| Area | VoltPulse |
|------|-----------|
| Topics | `vp.*` |
| Compose project | `voltpulse` |
| Profiles | `sense` `media` `stream` `data` `obs` `store` |
| Services | `pulse-gateway`, `grid-perception`, `grid-rules`, `pulse-api`, `pulse-web`, `pulse-notify`, `pulse-train`, `pulse-store` |
| Planes | Sense / Media / Stream / Data |
| API | `/api/v1/inspections`, `/assets`, `/alerts` — own OpenAPI |

## Pre-share / PR gate

- [ ] No internal brand strings in public surfaces
- [ ] No proprietary tree paths in commits
- [ ] No `.env` secrets
- [ ] Topics/OpenAPI grep-clean of internal prefixes
- [ ] Architecture wording is VoltPulse planes

Authority: `docs/anti-leak.md`.
